{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "bc2fea9db924243101116df4766e801ce351b295ad0aa37f9093c7b626eaba4d", "ja": "はぁ～、夢みたいだな～。\n……えへへ、えへへへ～♪", "zh": "哇～简直像做梦一样～\n……嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e7a1acf3e5998e5f155a87dd9eaf616107bac576b2451c75c0d6f6713de42772", "ja": "さっきからご機嫌だな、真。\n何してるんだ？", "zh": "看来你心情不错呢，真。\n你在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "d2a21a6ba8730ef874485fa4a2dd9bce70b7510051b9aae79608edccf135b8db", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！　お疲れ様です！\nえっと、今は、衣装チェックというか……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！辛苦了！\n这个嘛，算是在确认服装吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "28d01e54ebe523b45692229b126fd9cba569ce5240236545a78c9defe9bf4bac", "ja": "ボク今回、美咲さんが紙にデザインしてる\nときから、見せてもらってたんですよ。", "zh": "这次的服装，\n美咲还在画设计图的时候就让在下看过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "4a59bb5adeaaed59902507593a020d371615b5edd396c17eccb95b0cc9c06fc9", "ja": "そのときから、こんなカワイくてフワフワな衣装が\n着られるなんて！って、ドキドキしっぱなしで。", "zh": "在下从没想过能有机会穿上这么可爱又轻飘飘的服装，\n所以从那时开始就一直好期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "db54151b3ccc7757f2f0647b415591ce1c3f1eecb2c408459d819d88b8562593", "ja": "なんだか今でも信じられなくて……へへっ♪\nこうやって、何度も確かめたくなっちゃうんです。", "zh": "直到现在还是有点难以置信……嘿嘿♪\n所以才会想要像这样多确认几眼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5ada2eb94a7587c20c501b6d37608be952f0564e53adabcb2d38df5301702595", "ja": "うん、よく似合ってるよ。\n青羽さんに感謝しないとな。", "zh": "嗯，你穿起来很好看喔。\n不感谢青羽小姐的用心可不行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "f66661e364ec2006c2da35334b9d0f878d6c5af10f48fa88a4e216ae82d41dd9", "ja": "もうしてるに決まってるじゃないですか！\nお礼もちゃんと言いましたからね。わりと泣きながら！", "zh": "在下当然很感谢她啊！\n而且也好好道过谢了。在下还哭了出来呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1008_p", "source_sha256": "cb69ff23178e9b26eb393d1a28e76e3f31e22f426e151c1f08271ac694e23ee9", "ja": "そ、そうか。\n気持ちは十分伝わってそうだな……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n看来她应该确实感受到你的谢意了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "6e547df4dec2b134385e51c54a91e125a209364c51daad7f97e10cd3c79db8a5", "ja": "はぁ～、やっぱり衣装っていいなぁ……へへっ♪\n心が躍るって言うか、新鮮な気持ちになるっていうか。", "zh": "哇～这套服装真的很棒呢……嘿嘿♪\n总觉得有种雀跃，又有种新鲜的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "6f92ceb795255c9af735e99437e49d8068e6994465d24ec574ad0444dd1eaf61", "ja": "普段とは全然違うタイプの服が着られるから、\n新しいボクを見つけられる気がします！", "zh": "穿上和平时完全不同类型的服装，\n感觉好像能发现全新的自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "a32c91836e126ee690abec96a7efc00502a8bda12bb9de0e21518f9e9bf5cc5c", "ja": "こんな気持ちを味わえるのも、美咲さん……\nと、{$P$}のおかげですね！", "zh": "在下能体会到这种感受，都要感谢美咲……\n还有{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3b7d503bfa36e6b9179ae910050ee93038e71be1f349e72b9e396a131b6a8e34", "ja": "え？　いや、俺は別に何も……", "zh": "咦？可是，我没做什么啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "db850e56882c2136fca13e408ac8f107cf1a51246359e7d7b014bacafc4768e3", "ja": "なに言ってるんですか。美咲さんに聞いてますよ！\n方向性とかは{$P$}が考えてるって。", "zh": "你怎么这么说呢？美咲有告诉在下喔！\n这套服装的风格理念是{$P$}想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1014_p", "source_sha256": "422ad2ef83982c8d8ffe799e349d31ed5e3a10ae9bd36bae8c297d332870ad6f", "ja": "そりゃまあ、ざっくりとはな。\nでも本当に、大したことはしてないんだ。", "zh": "大方向确实是我想的没错。\n不过，我真的没做什么大不了的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "f36d395d6c7ab20d11bb1067e0994c30ef2ddd259f8d90407a694fc85d9a9f64", "ja": "その方向性が新鮮なんですってば！\nこのフワフワ加減とか、もう最高です！", "zh": "在下就是想说你决定的风格很新鲜啊！\n轻飘飘的程度拿捏得非常棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "dedc93268fd41ddc91d8b8bd992b34dfdd5aff6c4d7fd8c277321ce485d31e10", "ja": "見ててください。ボク、{$P$}の\n期待に応えられるように……。", "zh": "请你拭目以待吧。\n在下绝不会辜负{$P$}的期待……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "fbf843753ea90742c74f1939f937c0d8fe40a13b54525b990b388eb86b20b93f", "ja": "ライブで、この衣装の魅力を最高に引き出せるように！\nジャンジャンバリバリ、頑張りますからね！", "zh": "为了在演唱会上完美发挥这套服装的魅力，\n在下会卯足全力加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0084_1018_p", "source_sha256": "1b9a8c0d7c671e2ba00574d82c281f60a26bc7519bac11d1d2cb2141fa0af6a5", "ja": "（約束の笑顔に、笑顔でうなずく。衣装の魅力\n以上に、真自身の魅力が引き出せそうだな！）", "zh": "（真笑着跟我如此约定，而我也笑着点点头。\n看来她应该能发挥出超越这套服装的魅力吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
